    {2, 14, 2, 2, 0, 212, 2, 0x0000000000000000ULL, 1, 0x00000000acdfefefULL, -0.50f, 156.80f, 108.60f, "POE-1", "On the road south of the Castle Town drawbridge", "Hyrule Field", "Adult \x84" " Fairy Bow \x84" " Bottle", -128, 0, 0, "As adult Link, ride to Hyrule Field: on the road south of the Castle Town drawbridge.\nRide Epona through the spot until the Big Poe appears (on foot you may only get a small Poe).\nShoot it twice with the Fairy Bow before it flies off.\nGet off and talk to its soul to catch it in an empty bottle.\nSell it to the Poe Collector, in the old guardhouse at the Castle Town entrance. Five earn a bottle."},
